    <item>
      <title>Linux 7.3 预计修复超 2000 个 CVE，AI 扫描让内核维护者不堪重负</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260902/Linux-7.3-%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A1%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E8%B6%85-2000-%E4%B8%AA-CVEAI-%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E8%AE%A9%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E8%80%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%A0%AA%E9%87%8D%E8%B4%9F/</link>
